		{"text": "C", "rect": [57.14, 627.70, 86.75, 668.70], "fontSize": 41.0},
		{"text": "onventionally, therapeutic response", "rect": [80.17, 656.07, 215.18, 664.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "has been assessed on the basis of", "rect": [80.17, 645.11, 215.23, 653.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "serial", "rect": [80.17, 634.07, 100.99, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor", "rect": [106.60, 634.07, 130.36, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "size", "rect": [135.98, 634.07, 150.29, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "measurements,", "rect": [155.92, 634.07, 215.13, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "most notably according to the Response", "rect": [57.14, 623.11, 215.20, 631.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Evaluation Criteria in Solid Tumors, or", "rect": [57.14, 612.07, 215.19, 620.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "RECIST, criteria (1,2). However, preclin-", "rect": [57.14, 601.11, 215.21, 609.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ical assessment of new therapies, such as", "rect": [57.14, 590.07, 215.21, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "antiangiogenic agents, has highlighted the", "rect": [57.14, 579.11, 215.23, 587.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "limitations associated with standard mor-", "rect": [57.14, 568.07, 215.22, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "phologic measurements. In particular, re-", "rect": [57.14, 557.11, 215.20, 565.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "sponse may be assessed better by noting", "rect": [57.14, 546.07, 215.22, 554.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "alterations in vascular perfusion rather", "rect": [57.14, 535.11, 215.21, 543.90], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "than size (3–5), and functional measure-", "rect": [57.14, 524.07, 215.23, 532.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ments may therefore be more appropri-", "rect": [57.14, 513.12, 215.21, 521.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ate.", "rect": [57.14, 502.08, 71.79, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Perfusion", "rect": [79.22, 502.08, 115.66, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "computed", "rect": [123.10, 502.08, 161.34, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tomography", "rect": [168.75, 502.08, 215.12, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "(CT) is a technology that enables depic-", "rect": [57.14, 491.12, 215.20, 499.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tion of tumor vascular physiology (6). In", "rect": [57.14, 480.08, 215.19, 488.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "addition to being noninvasive and fast,", "rect": [57.14, 469.12, 215.18, 477.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "perfusion CT can be repeated sequen-", "rect": [57.14, 458.08, 215.21, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tially to assess temporal changes in tumor", "rect": [57.14, 447.12, 215.20, 455.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "blood flow, which is likely to be of clinical", "rect": [57.14, 436.08, 215.21, 444.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "importance", "rect": [57.14, 425.12, 101.07, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "for", "rect": [107.48, 425.12, 118.71, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "monitoring", "rect": [125.12, 425.12, 167.41, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor", "rect": [173.86, 425.12, 197.62, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "re-", "rect": [204.01, 425.12, 215.07, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "sponse to antiangiogenic therapies and", "rect": [57.14, 414.08, 215.21, 422.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "other treatments.", "rect": [57.14, 403.12, 124.87, 411.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Commercial CT software is used to", "rect": [72.10, 392.08, 215.13, 400.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "obtain quantitative perfusion measure-", "rect": [57.14, 381.12, 215.20, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ments,", "rect": [57.14, 370.08, 84.36, 378.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "including", "rect": [91.99, 370.08, 127.85, 378.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tissue", "rect": [135.44, 370.08, 158.26, 378.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "blood", "rect": [165.89, 370.08, 188.07, 378.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "flow,", "rect": [195.70, 370.08, 215.10, 378.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "blood volume, mean transit time, and", "rect": [57.14, 359.12, 215.17, 367.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "capillary permeability (6). CT perfusion", "rect": [57.14, 348.08, 215.19, 356.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "measurements", "rect": [57.14, 337.12, 115.50, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "have", "rect": [122.50, 337.12, 141.09, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "been", "rect": [148.09, 337.12, 167.33, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "shown", "rect": [174.33, 337.12, 200.08, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "to", "rect": [207.10, 337.12, 215.09, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "change as a result of antiangiogenesis", "rect": [57.14, 326.08, 215.18, 334.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "therapy (6,7). Measurements obtained", "rect": [57.14, 315.12, 215.18, 323.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "with such software have been demon-", "rect": [57.14, 304.08, 215.19, 312.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "strated to be reliable (8–12) and repro-", "rect": [227.05, 656.07, 385.09, 664.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ducible (13), given the assumption that", "rect": [227.05, 645.03, 385.07, 653.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "measurement of a representative sec-", "rect": [227.05, 634.07, 385.10, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tion is sufficient to evaluate an entire", "rect": [227.05, 623.03, 385.08, 631.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor.", "rect": [227.05, 612.07, 254.43, 620.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Nevertheless, tumors are heteroge-", "rect": [242.00, 601.03, 385.04, 609.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "neous.", "rect": [227.05, 590.07, 253.29, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Accordingly,", "rect": [258.68, 590.07, 308.87, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "section", "rect": [314.25, 590.07, 342.45, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "thickness", "rect": [347.86, 590.07, 385.01, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "and selection, variables that have not", "rect": [227.05, 579.03, 385.07, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "been well studied in the past, might in-", "rect": [227.05, 568.07, 385.08, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "fluence the overall results, especially for", "rect": [227.05, 557.03, 385.07, 565.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "comparisons of sections from two ex-", "rect": [227.05, 546.07, 385.08, 554.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "aminations performed with a substan-", "rect": [227.05, 535.03, 385.08, 543.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tial time interval. By the same token, CT", "rect": [227.05, 524.07, 385.06, 532.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "perfusion of the entire tumor volume—", "rect": [227.05, 513.03, 385.07, 521.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "for example, a multisection approach", "rect": [227.05, 502.08, 385.10, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "used to cover the entire z-axis of the", "rect": [227.05, 491.04, 385.09, 499.84], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor— could", "rect": [227.05, 480.08, 282.70, 488.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "potentially", "rect": [288.96, 480.08, 330.69, 488.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "reduce", "rect": [336.99, 480.08, 364.21, 488.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "this", "rect": [370.53, 480.08, 385.03, 488.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "error. Thus, the purpose of our study", "rect": [227.05, 469.04, 385.07, 477.84], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "was", "rect": [227.05, 458.08, 242.38, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "to", "rect": [247.70, 458.08, 255.69, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "compare", "rect": [261.06, 458.08, 295.93, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "prospectively", "rect": [301.25, 458.08, 354.06, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "single-", "rect": [359.43, 458.08, 385.02, 466.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "section and multisection CT perfusion", "rect": [227.05, 447.04, 385.10, 455.84], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "for tumor blood flow determination in", "rect": [227.05, 436.08, 385.11, 444.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "an animal model.", "rect": [227.05, 425.04, 295.60, 433.84], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Materials and Methods", "rect": [233.04, 384.99, 318.66, 393.99], "fontSize": 9.0},
		{"text": "Animal Model", "rect": [227.05, 361.11, 278.19, 370.11], "fontSize": 9.0},
		{"text": "All animal protocols and experiments", "rect": [227.05, 348.15, 385.08, 356.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "were approved by the institutional ani-", "rect": [227.05, 337.12, 385.07, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "mal care and use committee before the", "rect": [227.05, 326.16, 385.10, 334.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "study was initiated. For all experiments", "rect": [227.05, 315.12, 385.08, 323.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [227.05, 304.16, 241.72, 312.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "procedures,", "rect": [248.71, 304.16, 296.63, 312.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "anesthesia", "rect": [303.57, 304.16, 345.30, 312.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "was", "rect": [352.25, 304.16, 367.58, 312.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "in-", "rect": [374.57, 304.16, 385.00, 312.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "duced by injecting intraperitoneally a", "rect": [227.05, 293.12, 385.07, 301.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "mixture of ketamine (Ketaject; Phoenix", "rect": [227.05, 282.16, 385.10, 290.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Pharmaceutical, St Joseph, Mo), at a", "rect": [227.05, 271.13, 385.08, 279.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "dose", "rect": [227.05, 260.16, 245.47, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "of", "rect": [251.09, 260.16, 258.75, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "5", "rect": [264.38, 260.16, 268.79, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "mg", "rect": [274.89, 260.16, 286.95, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "per", "rect": [292.53, 260.16, 306.06, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "kilogram", "rect": [311.70, 260.16, 346.75, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "of", "rect": [352.31, 260.16, 359.97, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "body", "rect": [365.61, 260.16, 385.00, 268.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "weight, and xylazine (Bayer, Shawnee", "rect": [227.05, 249.12, 385.07, 257.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Mission, Kan), at a dose of 5 mg/kg.", "rect": [227.05, 238.16, 385.07, 246.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "When necessary, booster anesthetic in-", "rect": [227.05, 227.12, 385.07, 235.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "jections at 10% of these doses were ad-", "rect": [227.05, 216.16, 385.07, 224.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "ministered intraperitoneally every 30–60", "rect": [227.05, 205.13, 385.12, 213.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "minutes.", "rect": [227.05, 194.16, 261.61, 202.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "The", "rect": [267.17, 194.16, 282.50, 202.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "experiments", "rect": [288.07, 194.16, 337.46, 202.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "were", "rect": [343.05, 194.16, 362.94, 202.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "per-", "rect": [368.57, 194.16, 385.03, 202.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "formed by implanting a well-established", "rect": [227.05, 183.13, 385.09, 191.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor model (14,15), R3230 mammary", "rect": [227.05, 172.16, 385.09, 180.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "adenocarcinoma (Center for Molecular", "rect": [227.05, 161.13, 385.09, 169.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Imaging Research, Massachusetts Gen-", "rect": [227.05, 150.16, 385.10, 158.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "eral Hospital, Boston, Mass), in 11 Fi-", "rect": [227.05, 139.12, 385.07, 147.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "scher-344 female rats (Taconic Farms,", "rect": [227.05, 128.16, 385.10, 136.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Germantown, NY). These rats were of", "rect": [227.05, 117.13, 385.10, 125.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "the same strain as the rat from which", "rect": [227.05, 106.16, 385.07, 114.96], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "the tumor was originally derived (mean", "rect": [227.05, 95.13, 385.10, 103.92], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "weight", "rect": [227.05, 84.17, 253.46, 92.97], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "±", "rect": [261.06, 84.01, 261.06, 92.81], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "standard", "rect": [276.02, 84.17, 311.22, 92.97], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "deviation", "rect": [318.88, 84.17, 355.41, 92.97], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "[SD],", "rect": [362.99, 84.17, 384.98, 92.97], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "150 g", "rect": [227.05, 73.13, 248.46, 81.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "±", "rect": [250.79, 72.97, 250.79, 81.77], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "20; age range, 7–9 weeks). The", "rect": [260.40, 73.13, 385.05, 81.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor model was selected because of its", "rect": [227.05, 62.17, 385.07, 70.97], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "acute", "rect": [227.05, 51.13, 248.40, 59.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "response", "rect": [255.95, 51.13, 291.81, 59.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "to", "rect": [299.36, 51.13, 307.35, 59.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "arsenic", "rect": [314.90, 51.13, 343.59, 59.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "trioxide,", "rect": [351.12, 51.13, 385.03, 59.93], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "which enabled controlled modulation of", "rect": [396.95, 656.07, 555.00, 664.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "blood flow (16).", "rect": [396.95, 645.03, 460.45, 653.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "A parent tumor (approximately 1", "rect": [411.97, 634.07, 555.01, 642.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "cm in diameter) was initially harvested", "rect": [396.95, 623.03, 555.00, 631.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "from a live carrier. Within 30 minutes", "rect": [396.95, 612.07, 555.00, 620.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "of its dissection and removal, the tumor", "rect": [396.95, 601.03, 554.97, 609.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "was homogenized with a tissue grinder", "rect": [396.95, 590.07, 554.99, 598.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "(model", "rect": [396.95, 579.03, 424.98, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "23;", "rect": [431.62, 579.03, 444.34, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Kontes", "rect": [451.03, 579.03, 479.23, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Glass,", "rect": [485.87, 579.03, 510.14, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Vineland,", "rect": [516.81, 579.03, 554.95, 587.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "NJ),", "rect": [396.95, 568.07, 414.22, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [420.22, 568.07, 434.89, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "the", "rect": [440.94, 568.07, 453.66, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor", "rect": [459.63, 568.07, 484.09, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "cells", "rect": [490.10, 568.07, 507.37, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "were", "rect": [513.37, 568.07, 533.26, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "sus-", "rect": [539.25, 568.07, 554.89, 576.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "pended in 7 mL of a culture medium", "rect": [396.95, 557.03, 554.95, 565.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "(RPMI 1640; INC Biomedicals, Aurora,", "rect": [396.95, 546.07, 554.98, 554.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Ill). An aseptic technique was used. In", "rect": [396.95, 535.03, 554.97, 543.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "prior control experiments performed in", "rect": [396.95, 524.07, 554.99, 532.87], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "our laboratory, this process resulted in", "rect": [396.95, 513.03, 554.98, 521.83], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "a concentration of 1", "rect": [396.95, 502.08, 483.86, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "×", "rect": [488.73, 501.91, 488.73, 510.71], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "10", "rect": [500.95, 502.08, 510.74, 510.88], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "8", "rect": [510.69, 506.55, 513.44, 512.05], "fontSize": 5.50},
		{"text": "cells per", "rect": [519.24, 502.15, 554.93, 510.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "milliliter, with more than 95% cellular", "rect": [396.95, 491.12, 554.98, 499.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "viability. During direct imaging, 0.2– 0.3", "rect": [396.95, 480.15, 554.97, 488.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "mL of the tumor cell suspension was", "rect": [396.95, 469.12, 555.00, 477.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "injected slowly with an 18-gauge needle", "rect": [396.95, 458.15, 554.97, 466.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "into the mammary fat pad.", "rect": [396.95, 447.12, 503.58, 455.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "Animals were observed every 3– 4", "rect": [411.90, 436.15, 554.96, 444.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "days to measure tumor growth. Tumors", "rect": [396.95, 425.12, 554.97, 433.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "were allowed to grow for 14 –24 days,", "rect": [396.95, 414.15, 554.97, 422.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "until the desired treatment size (1.8 –", "rect": [396.95, 403.12, 554.97, 411.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "2.0 cm) was achieved. Tumor size was", "rect": [396.95, 392.15, 554.97, 400.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "chosen", "rect": [396.95, 381.12, 424.65, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "to", "rect": [430.37, 381.12, 438.37, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "match", "rect": [444.14, 381.12, 468.75, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "size", "rect": [474.48, 381.12, 489.31, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "optimally", "rect": [495.08, 381.12, 531.75, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "with", "rect": [537.46, 381.12, 554.90, 389.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "maximum z-axis coverage (four-section", "rect": [396.95, 370.15, 555.00, 378.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "CT acquisition at 5-mm thickness", "rect": [396.95, 359.12, 531.86, 367.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "=", "rect": [534.80, 358.96, 534.80, 367.76], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "20", "rect": [545.12, 359.12, 554.91, 367.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "mm). Two authors (A.H., H.P.) per-", "rect": [396.95, 348.15, 554.99, 356.95], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "formed", "rect": [396.95, 337.12, 425.80, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "tumor", "rect": [431.74, 337.12, 456.19, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
		{"text": "induction,", "rect": [462.13, 337.12, 502.23, 345.91], "fontSize": 8.80},
